* declaring data for meta-analysis
meta set log_RR_PPV_comp_ref se, studylabel(author_year) eslabel(log_RR)

* performing meta-regression
meta regress agecovariate, se(khartung) eform

* calculate total participants
gsort study_number -num_participants //sorting number of participants in descending order
by study_number: gen tag = _n == 1 //tagging first entry
count if tag //check that number of rows is 4
quietly sum num_participants if tag
display r(sum) //summing and displaying total number of participants included in the meta-regression

quietly sum num_participants //summing everything although 50-54 group is counted multiple times
display r(sum)

* make bubbleplot
